{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the RNA encoder choice (scgpt vs. scvi_n200) in a multimodal multiprofile setup using the high-performing imagenet_vit_l image encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion. The validation accuracy of 0.519957 and F1 of 0.479067 are lower than the scvi_n200-based baseline (config_008), suggesting the RNA encoder choice may influence performance. However, the exact contribution of this decision versus other design elements remains uncertain due to limited comparative evidence."
}

